Screen 9 — Order Routing & KDS/Printer Rules
Screen 8 creates the stations.
Screen 9 determines where orders go.
Visual Routing Builder
For example:
Category = Burger
→ Grill Station
→ Grill KDS
Category = Fries
→ Fry Station
→ Fry KDS
Category = Coffee
→ Beverage Station
→ Beverage KDS
More advanced rules
IF:
Outlet = VIP Lounge
AND Product Category = Dessert
THEN:
→ VIP Kitchen Station
Or:
IF Grill Station = Offline
THEN:
→ Backup Grill Station
This should be a no-code rule builder.
Routing priority
1. Product-specific rule
2. Category rule
3. Outlet rule
4. Kitchen default
That prevents configuration conflicts.
