One AI feature I would add to Board 1
I don't want AI only appearing in Board 6.
Put an AI Configuration Assistant directly into Board 1.
For example, the administrator writes:
Create a quick-service burger restaurant in Park A. Opening hours are 10 AM–11 PM. It has four POS terminals, 
one grill station, one fryer station and one beverage station. It supports dine-in, takeaway and QR ordering.
TICVAI generates a proposed configuration:
Outlet: Burger House
Template: Quick Service
Hours: 10:00–23:00
POS: 4
Kitchen Stations: 3
Channels: Dine-In / Takeaway / QR
Suggested routing: Generated
Then:
Review Configuration Submit for Approval Publish → →
That aligns much more strongly with TICVAI's AI-first positioning than simply adding an AI chatbot later.
