TICVAI F&B — BOARD 3
Kitchen, KDS & Order Fulfilment Management — Scope of Work
1. Purpose
The Kitchen, KDS & Order Fulfilment Board shall provide a centralized, real-time operational platform for 
managing the complete lifecycle of Food & Beverage orders from the moment an order is confirmed until 
preparation, assembly, guest notification, collection/service, and completion.
The solution shall support orders originating from:
 Fixed POS
 Mobile POS
 Self-Service Kiosk
 QR Table Ordering
 Mobile Application
 B2C Web
 Dine-In
 Takeaway
 VIP / Hospitality
 Group / School Orders
 Event Catering
 Pre-Orders
 Future third-party delivery integrations
All channels shall feed into a single F&B Order & Fulfilment Engine.
The operational lifecycle shall support:

TICVAI / F&B BACKEND STRUCTURE MODULE
CONFIDENTIAL | 33
Order Received Validation Firing Decision Kitchen Routing Station Queue Preparation → → → → → →
Expediting Ready Guest/Staff Notification Served/Collected Completed → → → →
The module shall support advanced kitchen operations including Hold & Fire, Fire Now, phased/course firing, 
timed firing, dynamic kitchen routing, KDS, kitchen printers, preparation SLAs, priority orders, buzzers, 
digital collection notifications, exception management and AI-assisted kitchen optimization.
