Reservation Capacity Engine
I strongly recommend adding this capability.
TICVAI shouldn't simply ask:
Is Table 10 free at 7 PM?
It should calculate:
Table Capacity + Party Size + Reservation Duration + Combination Rules + Current Occupancy + Future 
Reservations + Turnaround Buffer
Example:
Reservation:
6 guests
7:30 PM
Expected duration: 120 min
TICVAI determines:
T12 capacity = 4 
T14 capacity = 6 ✓
T18 + T19 = 8 ✓
TICVAI recommends:

TICVAI / F&B BACKEND STRUCTURE MODULE
CONFIDENTIAL | 67
T14 — Best Match
rather than wasting an eight-seat combined table.
