Outcome Measurement
This shared architecture shall later allow Retail, Shared Inventory & Procurement and other TICVAI modules to
use the same intelligence infrastructure, while Board 6 provides the specialized F&B KPIs, forecasts, 
recommendations and management workflows required for Food & Beverage operations.
The F&B module is therefore completed through six connected boards:
Board 1 — Outlet & Operational Configuration
Board 2 — Menu, Product, Recipe & Production Configuration
Board 3 — Kitchen, KDS & Order Fulfilment
Board 4 — Tables, Reservations & Service Management
Board 5 — Stock, Production, Replenishment & Operational Control
Board 6 — Intelligence, Analytics, Forecasting & AI Optimization.

